pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: roadmap-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 832, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.2
      align: [left, top]
      text: Three phases; one hard stop at the pilot gate
  - elementId: roadmap-axis
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 148, 832, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: phase-1-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [136, 140, 18, 18]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: phase-2-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [420, 140, 18, 18]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: phase-3-dot
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [704, 140, 18, 18]
    shapeName: ellipse
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: phase-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 76, 220, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 1 · Validate
  - elementId: phase-1-date
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 102, 220, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: M0–M3 · Aug–Oct 2026
  - elementId: phase-1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 174, 232, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Confirm demand in two cities, sign the distribution term sheet, and baseline unit economics.</p>
  - elementId: phase-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [336, 76, 220, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 2 · Pilot
  - elementId: phase-2-date
    elementType: text
    bounds: [336, 102, 220, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: M3–M9 · Nov 2026–May 2027
  - elementId: phase-2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [336, 174, 232, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Run the partner channel in one region; instrument acquisition, service quality, and contribution margin.</p>
  - elementId: phase-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [608, 76, 240, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 3 · Scale or stop
  - elementId: phase-3-date
    elementType: text
    bounds: [608, 102, 240, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: M9–M12 · Jun–Aug 2027
  - elementId: phase-3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [608, 174, 240, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>Pass the gate, expand to three regions; fail it, exercise the exit clause at fixed cost.</p>
  - elementId: gate-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [286, 268, 200, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.35
      align: [left, top]
      text: GATE 1 · M3 — term sheet signed, unit cost ≤ USD 42
  - elementId: gate-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [570, 268, 220, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.35
      align: [left, top]
      text: GATE 2 · M9 — contribution margin ≥ 12%, churn ≤ 4%
  - elementId: risk-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 338, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: risk-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 354, 390, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Risk · partner dependency.</strong> Trigger: partner misses two quarterly service targets. Mitigation: dual-source clause; owner: COO.</p>
  - elementId: risk-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [478, 354, 390, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Risk · margin erosion.</strong> Trigger: discount depth > 8% for two months. Mitigation: price floor and monthly review; owner: CFO.</p>
  - elementId: roadmap-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 500, 832, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "Source: implementation plan v3 (June 2026); gate thresholds set with the board; dates assume a Q3 2026 start."
